{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019MMtXBxUHY2MfqZUnctAeC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Taiwan news November 10 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News\"},{\"title\":\"Front Page - Taipei Times\",\"url\":\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World\",\"url\":\"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Journal\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal\"},{\"title\":\"TVBS News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Daily\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily\"},{\"title\":\"TaiwanPlus\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan\"},{\"title\":\"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News\",\"url\":\"https://focustaiwan.tw/\"}]\n\nI ran one search and didn't find anything dated specifically to November 10, 2026. The most recent items are from November 6–9.\n\n- **Focus Taiwan (CNA), listed as current:** Headlines include a second batch of F-16V jets arriving in Taiwan, a Taiwan military live-fire drill in Kinmen, and Taiwan's push for independent satellite launches. Taiwan wins 48 golds at Asian Sport Stacking Championships.\n- **Taiwan News, about 2 days old:** It reported a magnitude 4.2 earthquake in central Taiwan, and a ban on Chinese-owned yachts from Taiwan ports under revised entry rules.\n- **Taipei Times, dated November 6–9:** Taiwan's government ordered its financial regulator to stabilize the stock market during a tech-led sell-off, and TSMC shares fell as much as 9.8 percent that day. A separate November 9 report said an investigation into Nvidia's CEO is unlikely to significantly affect Taiwan's AI supply chain.\n\nThese are from search snippets, so check the source sites for exact dates and det